WEBVTT

01:13.570 --> 01:19.700
It seems that this liquid is related to
lrasaki Riko and Kaga Kouichi's rampages.

01:20.370 --> 01:26.370
<b><i>Revelations - Mastermind</i></b>

01:20.700 --> 01:26.920
Those needle marks on their arms were from
taking this liquid as a shot, not from an IV.

01:27.460 --> 01:29.340
What for?

01:29.340 --> 01:33.050
Could that medicine be causing
the secondary mutation?

01:34.470 --> 01:35.470
It's the opposite.

01:37.390 --> 01:41.310
It suppresses the effects of mutant awakening
and prevents their powers from going berserk.

01:42.140 --> 01:45.850
It's been shown to suppress
the power of their genes.

01:46.390 --> 01:49.150
To suppress the mutant
awakening effect?

01:49.940 --> 01:57.450
Which means you knew about the string
of mutant incidents in Tohoku.

01:58.570 --> 01:58.990
Yes.

02:00.070 --> 02:01.580
You lied to us?

02:03.410 --> 02:04.200
I'm sorry.

02:06.790 --> 02:08.920
Just as you've discovered,

02:10.170 --> 02:14.880
there have been many mutations
here over recent years.

02:16.090 --> 02:19.590
I have been giving this suppressant
to Riko and the others

02:20.300 --> 02:23.560
so that their mutant genes
wouldn't be affected.

02:24.220 --> 02:28.480
Then I'm afraid the suppressant
is not very effective.

02:28.810 --> 02:29.770
You're right.

02:30.560 --> 02:34.480
Especially Riko, who's been
forgetting her instruments,

02:34.480 --> 02:37.780
and has shown hints of going berserk
over the past few weeks.

02:38.990 --> 02:43.870
As such, I was trying to develop
an even stronger suppressant.

02:44.830 --> 02:48.410
I should vaccinate them
as quickly as possible.

02:48.920 --> 02:49.540
I agree.

02:50.290 --> 02:52.380
Just what kind of research
were you doing

02:52.380 --> 02:55.590
that made you stay
in such a dangerous place?

02:57.920 --> 03:03.180
This laboratory is at the center of
the mutant incidents.

03:03.640 --> 03:04.970
Does this have any relation
to your research?

03:05.930 --> 03:10.440
This is important research for
both humans and mutants.

03:11.060 --> 03:12.650
That's all I can tell you.

03:13.520 --> 03:14.610
Dr. Sasaki!

03:15.650 --> 03:21.160
I saw a mutant lose control
to Damon Hall syndrome in the past.

03:22.200 --> 03:24.660
I never want to see that again!

03:30.960 --> 03:34.460
The mutant phenomenon is
not limited to this area,

03:34.460 --> 03:36.880
but is in fact quickly
spreading in its effect.

03:37.380 --> 03:38.460
Secondary mutation.

03:39.170 --> 03:42.720
There are only one or two people
who have undergone it

03:42.720 --> 03:44.430
without exhibiting
Damon Hall syndrome.

03:45.300 --> 03:46.810
Actually, only Emma has.

03:48.350 --> 03:49.480
Where's Emma?

03:50.600 --> 03:53.650
She was with us
just a moment ago.

03:53.650 --> 03:56.150
I don't see your
other researcher, either.

03:56.650 --> 03:58.070
Y-Yes.

03:58.530 --> 03:59.070
Let's search.

03:59.650 --> 04:01.700
We have to give
the vaccine to him, too.

04:01.700 --> 04:02.570
Wait!

04:02.570 --> 04:04.870
Don't walk around
the facility on your own!

04:04.870 --> 04:06.700
I still have questions
I'd like to ask you.

04:08.290 --> 04:09.540
Remain here.

04:40.690 --> 04:43.950
I'm going to report this
to Professor X.

04:44.530 --> 04:45.070
Wait!

04:45.620 --> 04:47.700
Give me a little more time
before telling him-

04:47.700 --> 04:50.240
This isn't the time
to be so laid-back!

04:55.330 --> 04:55.830
Charles.

04:56.250 --> 04:57.460
Charles, it's Henry.

04:58.130 --> 04:59.090
Can you hear me?

05:08.890 --> 05:09.850
<i>Scott.</i>

05:10.850 --> 05:11.640
<i>Logan.</i>

05:12.770 --> 05:13.480
Ororo.

05:14.520 --> 05:15.140
<i>Emma.</i>

05:20.980 --> 05:21.730
<i>It's no use.</i>

05:22.190 --> 05:25.070
<i>Something is blocking
my psychic waves.</i>

05:41.210 --> 05:42.050
<i>That's...</i>

05:46.680 --> 05:47.300
<i>This isn't good!</i>

05:47.890 --> 05:49.930
<i>The longer I remain
in this space,</i>

05:49.930 --> 05:51.560
<i>the more my neural sensitivity
will most assuredly degrade.</i>

05:52.350 --> 05:54.560
<i>I must find a way to
escape from here.</i>

05:58.400 --> 05:59.190
<i>This is...</i>

06:00.400 --> 06:02.070
<i>a sound from a living being.</i>

06:03.150 --> 06:04.900
<i>I hear it from the depths</i>
<i>of this space.</i>

06:07.070 --> 06:11.830
<i>Could this space be a level
of human consciousness?</i>

06:13.240 --> 06:17.160
<i>The only people capable of creating
something so extreme...</i>

06:18.120 --> 06:19.040
<i>are telepaths.</i>

06:19.580 --> 06:21.540
<i>Considerably powerful ones, at that.</i>

06:28.340 --> 06:30.390
<i>If my opponent is a telepath,</i>

06:30.930 --> 06:33.010
<i>I may be able to break him.</i>

06:53.530 --> 06:55.330
<i>My will, or yours...</i>

06:55.830 --> 06:57.160
<i>which one will win out?</i>

07:01.920 --> 07:03.500
The communication device
is functioning properly.

07:04.250 --> 07:06.460
Something may have
happened to Charles.

07:06.460 --> 07:07.300
To Charles?

07:08.420 --> 07:12.260
If Emma were here, I could have her
telepathically contact him, but...

07:13.140 --> 07:14.390
Just where is she?

07:34.830 --> 07:36.370
Beyond that door...

07:38.450 --> 07:42.710
lies what you seek, correct?

07:46.300 --> 07:47.460
Miss Frost.

07:48.550 --> 07:49.800
Why are you here?

07:50.590 --> 07:52.510
Following you.

07:53.930 --> 07:55.350
I didn't notice.

07:56.390 --> 08:01.690
A password-protected elevator
hidden in a wall is

08:01.690 --> 08:03.440
quite an elaborate security measure.

08:04.150 --> 08:05.270
This is a problem.

08:05.270 --> 08:06.860
Outsiders shouldn't waltz in.

08:06.860 --> 08:08.230
And you are?

08:08.230 --> 08:11.400
I'm an employee of
this research facility.

08:11.400 --> 08:12.110
Is that so?

08:12.660 --> 08:15.450
Standing in front of me is
a young Japanese man,

08:16.280 --> 08:20.250
but when I turn my body to diamond
with my secondary mutation,

08:20.250 --> 08:22.620
I lose my telepathic abilities.

08:23.330 --> 08:27.880
In exchange, it reveals
the power of other telepaths.

08:29.300 --> 08:31.550
How are you, Jason?

08:32.380 --> 08:35.010
No, Mastermind.

08:38.350 --> 08:40.980
As I'd expect from
the Inner Circle's leader.

08:40.980 --> 08:43.940
You assumed the form of
the Japanese man Sanada Jun,

08:43.940 --> 08:47.900
and then deceived us all,
starting with Sasaki Yui.

08:48.900 --> 08:51.570
I thought you had
ceased your crimes,

08:51.570 --> 08:56.370
but I never thought I'd find you hidden
in the mountains of Japan.

08:57.280 --> 09:01.200
I knew I should have killed you
when you first tried

09:01.200 --> 09:02.960
to leave the Inner Circle.

09:03.870 --> 09:06.380
You discarded our
noble ideals as insane,

09:06.880 --> 09:11.670
vile designs and
walked out on us.

09:12.170 --> 09:15.430
Well, I did see it coming, slightly.

09:16.010 --> 09:17.180
Emma Frost.

09:24.850 --> 09:26.690
She's nowhere to be found.

09:26.690 --> 09:28.730
Where did she go?

09:28.730 --> 09:29.730
Could she be outside?

09:30.690 --> 09:31.440
No.

09:32.320 --> 09:33.320
I don't think so.

09:34.900 --> 09:37.070
I can smell her beyond this wall.

09:38.280 --> 09:39.330
Then...

09:40.370 --> 09:42.080
This is hollow.

10:01.220 --> 10:02.930
When you're in
someone else's house,

10:02.930 --> 10:05.810
you should be a gentleman
and mind your manners.

10:06.770 --> 10:10.360
Wild guys are my type.

10:14.940 --> 10:16.900
Will you tell me, I wonder.

10:17.400 --> 10:18.950
What is your goal?

10:26.040 --> 10:27.960
Very well.

10:28.420 --> 10:33.750
To celebrate the reunion of
two old friends, I shall tell you.

10:43.220 --> 10:48.730
It was last year that I noticed the mutant
phenomenon in the Tohoku area.

10:48.730 --> 10:52.230
Yes, shortly after my fight
with the X-Men.

10:53.070 --> 10:58.450
How did you detect mutant signatures
that not even Professor X could?

10:58.450 --> 11:03.490
The Inner Circle's connections extend even to
this island country's underground society.

11:04.450 --> 11:09.170
Telepathy is not the only way
I obtain information.

11:09.170 --> 11:11.880
It can come from
the human mouth as well.

11:12.630 --> 11:13.710
I see.

11:14.300 --> 11:17.590
I suspected that there was
a great power at the root

11:17.590 --> 11:20.260
of the mutant phenomenon.

11:20.630 --> 11:25.260
So, you schemed to use that
power for your own goals?

11:26.140 --> 11:30.060
You targeted the research facility
at the heart of the phenomenon,

11:30.060 --> 11:33.020
and infiltrated it under
the guise of Sanada Jun.

11:33.480 --> 11:34.520
Correct.

11:35.150 --> 11:38.400
Emma, you're as
perceptive as always.

11:38.860 --> 11:43.490
I've earned enough trust
to enter this underground facility.

11:43.490 --> 11:50.160
And I've figured out what's
at the heart of this power.

11:54.630 --> 11:56.170
How about it?

11:56.170 --> 11:58.880
Want to team up with me again?

11:59.840 --> 12:03.510
I'd welcome anyone as
beautiful and powerful as you.

12:04.930 --> 12:06.850
Answer one more question for me.

12:06.850 --> 12:07.850
Gladly.

12:08.430 --> 12:11.270
In the battle against
the X-Men one year ago,

12:11.270 --> 12:14.860
were you the one who
showed Cyclops an illusion of me?

12:16.610 --> 12:22.200
It was a shame that you left us
before that fight.

12:22.700 --> 12:28.870
There was a chance that
you might join the X-Men after that.

12:30.250 --> 12:34.040
So I thought I'd have
them finish you off.

12:35.710 --> 12:38.090
Even that Cyclops

12:38.090 --> 12:42.340
turned into a wimp for a year after
Jean Grey died, pathetic don't you think?

12:43.470 --> 12:45.680
Just over the death of a woman.

12:45.680 --> 12:49.640
It just goes to show that there are some
truly half-assed mutants out there.

12:53.060 --> 12:54.310
I won't forgive you.

12:57.020 --> 12:58.270
Oh?

12:58.270 --> 13:00.400
Looks like you're refusing my offer.

13:00.820 --> 13:01.900
What a shame.

13:10.330 --> 13:12.160
Well, well.

13:12.160 --> 13:15.620
You've gained quite
the extravagant power.

13:16.210 --> 13:22.800
If I remember correctly, my powers
won't work on that beautiful body.

13:22.800 --> 13:26.930
But you become unable to
use telepathy yourself, right?

13:28.010 --> 13:30.560
How do you plan to attack?

13:36.310 --> 13:37.860
I had forgotten.

13:37.860 --> 13:41.030
You practice martial arts.

14:06.550 --> 14:07.300
Emma!

14:08.090 --> 14:09.600
What was that just now?!

14:10.050 --> 14:13.020
Everyone, attack that man!

14:13.470 --> 14:14.890
Attack Sanada?

14:14.890 --> 14:15.680
Why?

14:16.020 --> 14:19.810
That isn't a Japanese man
named Sanada Jun.

14:19.810 --> 14:21.980
He's just projecting an illusion.

14:21.980 --> 14:22.610
Illusion?

14:23.280 --> 14:24.150
That's ridiculous!

14:24.610 --> 14:26.400
She suddenly attacked me!

14:26.820 --> 14:27.570
She...

14:27.570 --> 14:28.780
she tried to kill me!

14:29.320 --> 14:30.410
That's right!

14:30.410 --> 14:31.780
It's her secondary mutation!

14:32.200 --> 14:33.290
That must be it!

14:35.200 --> 14:36.410
This scent.

14:37.330 --> 14:39.630
It's been bugging me.

14:39.630 --> 14:44.090
The smell of someone we hadn't
met all over the place.

14:44.710 --> 14:46.510
It's a bad smell.

14:46.510 --> 14:48.340
And it's not the only one.

14:48.340 --> 14:54.560
There's another strange
stench behind that door.

14:55.810 --> 14:57.940
You know something, don't you?

15:00.940 --> 15:01.690
Wolverine!

15:07.900 --> 15:09.110
Logan!

15:11.410 --> 15:12.490
Jean!

15:14.240 --> 15:18.210
Protect me.

15:31.840 --> 15:32.720
Wolverine!

15:33.260 --> 15:34.100
What...

15:45.360 --> 15:46.320
Stop it!

15:46.320 --> 15:48.650
What happened to him?

15:48.650 --> 15:53.160
He's probably seeing Cyclops
and us as enemies!

15:53.620 --> 15:55.330
He's under that man's power.

15:56.330 --> 15:57.290
That's awful!

16:10.590 --> 16:11.380
Wolverine!

16:12.470 --> 16:13.090
Wait!

16:14.550 --> 16:15.850
Kill them!

16:18.720 --> 16:20.100
Hisako, get away!

16:23.350 --> 16:24.400
Wolverine!

16:24.730 --> 16:26.360
It's me, Hisako!

16:26.860 --> 16:27.860
Stop, Hisako!

16:28.190 --> 16:29.030
Don't get close to him!

16:29.030 --> 16:30.280
Snap out of it!

16:32.650 --> 16:34.280
Please!

16:53.220 --> 16:55.300
Emma, Hisako, get back!

17:04.940 --> 17:06.690
Beast, come here now!

17:06.690 --> 17:07.230
<i>What's wrong?</i>

17:07.560 --> 17:10.440
<i>Wolverine and
Cyclops are fighting.</i>

17:10.440 --> 17:11.780
What do you mean?

17:11.780 --> 17:13.280
<i>I don't really know.</i>

17:13.280 --> 17:15.490
<i>Wolverine suddenly
started attacking us.</i>

17:15.910 --> 17:17.120
Wolverine did?

17:17.120 --> 17:19.030
<i>It's not looking good.</i>

17:19.700 --> 17:20.790
Where are you now?

17:20.790 --> 17:21.910
<i>In the underground facility.</i>

17:22.620 --> 17:23.250
Oh no!

17:53.860 --> 17:57.700
He's using Wolverine
to protect himself.

17:57.700 --> 17:59.950
Those two are scary!

18:00.700 --> 18:04.960
Cyclops is desperately fighting
for Wolverine's sake, too.

18:04.960 --> 18:08.630
Hisako, you must stay here, okay?

18:08.630 --> 18:09.710
I'll-

18:17.340 --> 18:19.970
"You must stay here, okay?"

18:22.560 --> 18:25.100
You always entertain me.

18:25.640 --> 18:28.560
Mash will take care of you now.

18:29.060 --> 18:32.230
Mash, savor the taste.

18:38.530 --> 18:40.030
Am I interrupting?

18:46.830 --> 18:47.870
Hisako!

18:47.870 --> 18:50.750
I'm an X-Man too!

19:20.990 --> 19:23.700
It looks like I'll have to put
you through a rough time.

19:29.080 --> 19:30.170
Cyclops!

19:39.050 --> 19:40.470
Don't hate me.

19:41.220 --> 19:41.930
Shit.

19:41.930 --> 19:44.720
Sanada, don't go there!

19:44.720 --> 19:45.180
Stop!

19:54.440 --> 19:55.770
What was that?

19:55.770 --> 19:57.690
Did it reflect?

20:00.900 --> 20:01.820
NOW!

20:02.910 --> 20:06.830
Jason, this is the end
of your illusion.

20:13.040 --> 20:15.290
I've broken your camouflage field.

20:15.880 --> 20:19.090
Everyone, this is
Sanada Jun's real identity.

20:20.470 --> 20:23.090
You're Inner Circle's...

20:25.300 --> 20:27.100
Mastermind!

20:27.560 --> 20:30.100
He's one of the four top leaders!

20:32.770 --> 20:35.610
Pleased to meet you, X-Men.

20:36.110 --> 20:42.570
Cyclops, this is the man who projected
my illusion to you a year ago.

20:43.700 --> 20:46.530
It's such a shame about Jean Grey.

20:46.530 --> 20:49.620
I extend my deepest sympathies.

20:50.160 --> 20:52.120
Bastard...!

20:53.080 --> 20:55.130
Everyone, back up!

20:55.130 --> 20:56.250
Wait, Cyclops!

20:58.000 --> 20:59.340
That system is...

21:00.550 --> 21:02.050
Don't stop me, Beast!

21:02.510 --> 21:03.380
Calm down!

21:03.760 --> 21:04.800
Cyclops!

21:05.180 --> 21:06.090
Hey!

21:06.850 --> 21:08.890
Is the party over already?

21:08.890 --> 21:09.810
Wolverine?

21:11.100 --> 21:12.270
Don't ask me anything!

21:24.700 --> 21:27.660
Looks like I made it back in time.

23:04.250 --> 23:09.130
The Inner Circle's leader who tries
to use the source of evil power,

23:09.130 --> 23:12.140
and the struggle which spreads
throughout the X-Men.

23:13.350 --> 23:17.140
And finally, Yui tells all.

23:18.060 --> 23:24.320
The cogs of the cruel yet unbearably
tragic fate begin to turn.

23:25.520 --> 23:31.070
<b><i>Countdown - Truth</i></b>

23:25.780 --> 23:29.030
Next time on X-Men: Truth.
